  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Can",
     "texto": [
      "**Мочь**: могу, можешь, может, можем, можете, могут. It goes with an infinitive and expresses ability or possibility; to ask for permission **можно** is used.",
      "**Я не могу** = I can't. **Ты можешь помочь?** = can you help?",
      "**Пойти** (on foot) and **поехать** (by transport) show that a specific journey is starting; here they appear as infinitives after **хотеть** and **мочь**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "«Мочь» and «уметь»",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Person",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "мочь (can)",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "уметь (to know how to)",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
